{"seq":5,"slug":"prefix-tuning","title":"Prefix Tuning 前缀微调","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fine-tuning/parameter-efficient-methods/prefix-tuning","wordCount":1269,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"prefix-tuning-前缀微调\">Prefix Tuning 前缀微调</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Prefix Tuning 是一种参数高效微调方法，通过在 Transformer 每一层的注意力机制前添加可学习的&quot;虚拟前缀&quot;向量来引导模型行为。这些前缀不对应任何真实的文本 Token，而是作为连续的软提示直接在注意力空间中工作。与全量微调冻结所有原始参数不同，Prefix Tuning 仅训练这些额外注入的前缀参数，可训练参数量通常不到模型总参数的 0.1%。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[输入 Token] --&gt; B[Embedding 层]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Layer 1]&#10;    P1[前缀向量 P1] --&gt; C&#10;    C --&gt; D[Layer 2]&#10;    P2[前缀向量 P2] --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; E[...]&#10;    PN[前缀向量 PN] --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[输出层]&#10;    subgraph 可训练参数&#10;        P1&#10;        P2&#10;        PN&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    A[输入 Token] --&gt; B[Embedding 层]\n    B --&gt; C[Layer 1]\n    P1[前缀向量 P1] --&gt; C\n    C --&gt; D[Layer 2]\n    P2[前缀向量 P2] --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; E[...]\n    PN[前缀向量 PN] --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[输出层]\n    subgraph 可训练参数\n        P1\n        P2\n        PN\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Prefix Tuning</th>\n<th>Prompt Tuning</th>\n<th>LoRA</th>\n<th>Full Fine-Tuning</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>插入位置</td>\n<td>每一层 KV 前缀</td>\n<td>仅输入嵌入层</td>\n<td>权重矩阵低秩分解</td>\n<td>所有参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可训练参数比</td>\n<td>~0.1%</td>\n<td>~0.01%</td>\n<td>0.1-1%</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>虚拟 Token 数</td>\n<td>10-50</td>\n<td>5-20</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推理开销</td>\n<td>占用上下文长度</td>\n<td>占用上下文长度</td>\n<td>可合并消除</td>\n<td>无额外</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多任务切换</td>\n<td>切换前缀即可</td>\n<td>切换软提示即可</td>\n<td>切换适配器</td>\n<td>需加载完整模型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"前缀的工作机制\">前缀的工作机制</h2><p>Prefix Tuning 的核心思想是在每一层的 Key 和 Value 矩阵前面拼接可学习的向量。假设原始注意力计算为 Attention(Q, K, V)，添加前缀后变为 Attention(Q, [P_K; K], [P_V; V])，其中 P_K 和 P_V 是该层对应的前缀向量。</p>\n<p>这种设计意味着每个注意力头在计算时，查询（Query）不仅会关注输入的真实 Token，还会关注前缀向量。前缀向量因此能够&quot;引导&quot;注意力的分配模式，间接影响模型的输出行为。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from peft import PrefixTuningConfig, get_peft_model, TaskType&#10;from transformers import AutoModelForCausalLM&#10;&#10;model = AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(&#10;    &quot;Qwen/Qwen3-8B&quot;,&#10;    torch_dtype=&quot;auto&quot;,&#10;    device_map=&quot;auto&quot;,&#10;)&#10;&#10;prefix_config = PrefixTuningConfig(&#10;    task_type=TaskType.CAUSAL_LM,&#10;    num_virtual_tokens=20,&#10;    prefix_projection=True,&#10;    encoder_hidden_size=256,&#10;    token_dim=model.config.hidden_size,&#10;    num_layers=model.config.num_hidden_layers,&#10;    num_attention_heads=model.config.num_attention_heads,&#10;)&#10;&#10;prefix_model = get_peft_model(model, prefix_config)&#10;prefix_model.print_trainable_parameters()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> peft </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PrefixTuningConfig, get_peft_model, TaskType</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transformers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoModelForCausalLM</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"Qwen/Qwen3-8B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    torch_dtype</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"auto\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    device_map</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"auto\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prefix_config </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PrefixTuningConfig(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    task_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">TaskType.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">CAUSAL_LM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    num_virtual_tokens</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    prefix_projection</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    encoder_hidden_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    token_dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model.config.hidden_size,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    num_layers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model.config.num_hidden_layers,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    num_attention_heads</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model.config.num_attention_heads,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prefix_model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> get_peft_model(model, prefix_config)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prefix_model.print_trainable_parameters()</span></span></code></pre></div><p>直接优化高维前缀向量往往不稳定，因此 Prefix Tuning 引入了一个重参数化技巧：使用一个较小的 MLP（前缀投影网络）来生成实际的前缀向量。训练时优化 MLP 的参数，训练结束后将 MLP 的输出固化为最终的前缀向量，推理时不再需要 MLP。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"prefix_config_with_projection = PrefixTuningConfig(&#10;    task_type=TaskType.CAUSAL_LM,&#10;    num_virtual_tokens=30,&#10;    prefix_projection=True,&#10;    encoder_hidden_size=512,&#10;)&#10;&#10;prefix_config_without_projection = PrefixTuningConfig(&#10;    task_type=TaskType.CAUSAL_LM,&#10;    num_virtual_tokens=30,&#10;    prefix_projection=False,&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prefix_config_with_projection </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PrefixTuningConfig(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    task_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">TaskType.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">CAUSAL_LM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    num_virtual_tokens</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    prefix_projection</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    encoder_hidden_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prefix_config_without_projection </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PrefixTuningConfig(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    task_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">TaskType.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">CAUSAL_LM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    num_virtual_tokens</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    prefix_projection</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配置</th>\n<th>prefix_projection=True</th>\n<th>prefix_projection=False</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>优化目标</td>\n<td>MLP 参数</td>\n<td>前缀向量本身</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>训练稳定性</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>参数量</td>\n<td>稍多（含 MLP）</td>\n<td>更少</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推荐场景</td>\n<td>默认选择</td>\n<td>极端参数受限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"prompt-tuning-对比\">Prompt Tuning 对比</h2><p>Prompt Tuning 是 Prefix Tuning 的简化版本，它只在输入嵌入层添加软提示向量，而不是在每一层都添加前缀。这意味着 Prompt Tuning 的可训练参数量更少，但表达能力也相对有限。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from peft import PromptTuningConfig, PromptTuningInit, get_peft_model&#10;&#10;prompt_config = PromptTuningConfig(&#10;    task_type=TaskType.CAUSAL_LM,&#10;    num_virtual_tokens=8,&#10;    prompt_tuning_init=PromptTuningInit.TEXT,&#10;    prompt_tuning_init_text=&quot;将以下文本分类为正面或负面：&quot;,&#10;    tokenizer_name_or_path=&quot;Qwen/Qwen3-8B&quot;,&#10;)&#10;&#10;prompt_model = get_peft_model(model, prompt_config)&#10;prompt_model.print_trainable_parameters()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> peft </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PromptTuningConfig, PromptTuningInit, get_peft_model</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prompt_config </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PromptTuningConfig(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    task_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">TaskType.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">CAUSAL_LM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    num_virtual_tokens</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    prompt_tuning_init</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PromptTuningInit.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    prompt_tuning_init_text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"将以下文本分类为正面或负面：\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    tokenizer_name_or_path</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Qwen/Qwen3-8B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prompt_model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> get_peft_model(model, prompt_config)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prompt_model.print_trainable_parameters()</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Prompt Tuning 有一个重要发现：随着模型规模增大，软提示的效果逐渐接近全量微调。在 10B+ 参数的模型上，仅 8-20 个虚拟 Token 就能达到不错的适配效果。这意味着对于足够大的模型，Prompt Tuning 可能是最具性价比的方法。</p>\n<p>P-Tuning v2 是 Prefix Tuning 在中文社区的改进版本，它将前缀扩展到每一层（类似 Prefix Tuning），但使用了不同的初始化策略和训练技巧：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from peft import PrefixTuningConfig, get_peft_model&#10;&#10;p_tuning_v2_config = PrefixTuningConfig(&#10;    task_type=TaskType.CAUSAL_LM,&#10;    num_virtual_tokens=20,&#10;    prefix_projection=True,&#10;    encoder_hidden_size=128,&#10;)&#10;&#10;p_tuning_model = get_peft_model(model, p_tuning_v2_config)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> peft </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PrefixTuningConfig, get_peft_model</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">p_tuning_v2_config </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PrefixTuningConfig(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    task_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">TaskType.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">CAUSAL_LM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    num_virtual_tokens</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    prefix_projection</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    encoder_hidden_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">p_tuning_model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> get_peft_model(model, p_tuning_v2_config)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"多任务场景应用\">多任务场景应用</h2><p>Prefix Tuning 在多任务和多租户场景中有天然优势。每个任务只需存储一组前缀向量（通常仅几 MB），切换任务时只需替换前缀，无需重新加载模型。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface PrefixTaskConfig {&#10;  taskName: string;&#10;  prefixLength: number;&#10;  prefixStorageSize: string;&#10;  switchLatency: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const multiTaskSetup: PrefixTaskConfig[] = [&#10;  {&#10;    taskName: &#39;中文摘要&#39;,&#10;    prefixLength: 20,&#10;    prefixStorageSize: &#39;2.4 MB&#39;,&#10;    switchLatency: &#39;&lt;1 ms&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    taskName: &#39;英文翻译&#39;,&#10;    prefixLength: 30,&#10;    prefixStorageSize: &#39;3.6 MB&#39;,&#10;    switchLatency: &#39;&lt;1 ms&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    taskName: &#39;代码生成&#39;,&#10;    prefixLength: 40,&#10;    prefixStorageSize: &#39;4.8 MB&#39;,&#10;    switchLatency: &#39;&lt;1 ms&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    taskName: &#39;情感分析&#39;,&#10;    prefixLength: 10,&#10;    prefixStorageSize: &#39;1.2 MB&#39;,&#10;    switchLatency: &#39;&lt;1 ms&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PrefixTaskConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  taskName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  prefixLength</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  prefixStorageSize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  switchLatency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> multiTaskSetup</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PrefixTaskConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    taskName: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'中文摘要'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    prefixLength: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    prefixStorageSize: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2.4 MB'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    switchLatency: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'&#x3C;1 ms'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    taskName: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'英文翻译'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    prefixLength: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    prefixStorageSize: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'3.6 MB'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    switchLatency: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'&#x3C;1 ms'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    taskName: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'代码生成'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    prefixLength: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    prefixStorageSize: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'4.8 MB'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    switchLatency: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'&#x3C;1 ms'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    taskName: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'情感分析'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    prefixLength: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    prefixStorageSize: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1.2 MB'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    switchLatency: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'&#x3C;1 ms'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在实际部署中，可以将多组前缀预加载到 GPU 显存中，通过索引快速切换。这种模式特别适合 API 服务需要同时支持多个定制化任务的场景，避免了为每个任务维护独立模型副本的开销。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>多任务方案</th>\n<th>模型副本数</th>\n<th>切换延迟</th>\n<th>存储成本</th>\n<th>适合任务数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Prefix Tuning</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>&lt;1 ms</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>10-100+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LoRA 适配器切换</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>~10 ms</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>10-50</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>完整模型副本</td>\n<td>N</td>\n<td>~1 s</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>2-5</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"训练实践要点\">训练实践要点</h2><p>Prefix Tuning 的训练比全量微调简单得多，但仍有一些关键参数需要调优。前缀长度（num_virtual_tokens）是最重要的超参数，它直接影响模型的适配能力和推理时的上下文占用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from transformers import TrainingArguments, Trainer&#10;&#10;training_args = TrainingArguments(&#10;    output_dir=&quot;./prefix-tuning-output&quot;,&#10;    num_train_epochs=5,&#10;    per_device_train_batch_size=8,&#10;    learning_rate=3e-2,&#10;    warmup_ratio=0.06,&#10;    weight_decay=0.01,&#10;    logging_steps=10,&#10;    save_strategy=&quot;epoch&quot;,&#10;    fp16=True,&#10;)&#10;&#10;trainer = Trainer(&#10;    model=prefix_model,&#10;    args=training_args,&#10;    train_dataset=train_dataset,&#10;    eval_dataset=eval_dataset,&#10;)&#10;&#10;trainer.train()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transformers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TrainingArguments, Trainer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">training_args </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TrainingArguments(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    output_dir</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./prefix-tuning-output\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    num_train_epochs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    per_device_train_batch_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    learning_rate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3e-2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    warmup_ratio</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.06</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    weight_decay</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.01</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    logging_steps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    save_strategy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"epoch\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    fp16</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">trainer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Trainer(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prefix_model,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    args</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">training_args,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    train_dataset</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">train_dataset,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    eval_dataset</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">eval_dataset,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">trainer.train()</span></span></code></pre></div><p>学习率的选择也至关重要。由于前缀参数是从零开始学习的（不像 LoRA 有预训练权重的信息），通常需要比 LoRA 更高的学习率（1e-2 到 5e-2），并配合适当的 warmup。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>超参数</th>\n<th>推荐范围</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>num_virtual_tokens</td>\n<td>10-50</td>\n<td>任务越复杂，所需前缀越长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>learning_rate</td>\n<td>1e-2 ~ 5e-2</td>\n<td>远高于 LoRA 的 1e-4 ~ 3e-4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>warmup_ratio</td>\n<td>0.03-0.1</td>\n<td>防止初期不稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>prefix_projection</td>\n<td>True</td>\n<td>默认开启重参数化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>encoder_hidden_size</td>\n<td>128-512</td>\n<td>投影网络的隐藏层维度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>epochs</td>\n<td>3-10</td>\n<td>收敛较快</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Prefix Tuning 通过在每层注入可学习前缀向量实现参数高效微调，可训练参数不到 0.1%</li>\n<li>前缀投影（重参数化）技巧显著提升训练稳定性，是默认推荐配置</li>\n<li>Prompt Tuning 是其简化版本，在大模型上效果接近全量微调</li>\n<li>多任务场景是 Prefix Tuning 的核心优势，前缀切换延迟极低</li>\n<li>训练时需要比 LoRA 更高的学习率，并注意 warmup 配置</li>\n<li>前缀长度是最关键的超参数，需根据任务复杂度在 10-50 之间调整</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Prefix Tuning 前缀微调","id":"prefix-tuning-前缀微调"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"前缀的工作机制","id":"前缀的工作机制"},{"level":2,"text":"Prompt Tuning 对比","id":"prompt-tuning-对比"},{"level":2,"text":"多任务场景应用","id":"多任务场景应用"},{"level":2,"text":"训练实践要点","id":"训练实践要点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Adapter 适配器方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fine-tuning/parameter-efficient-methods/adapter-methods"},"next":{"title":"RLHF 与人类偏好对齐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fine-tuning/alignment-techniques/rlhf"}}